Manual de Usos Consuntivos da Água no Brasil — ANA, segunda edição (@wu-usos-ana: 0, is #reference, #part-of @wu-sources) { r_74SR4SEK71SX7RTST2NB6Z5YJG
Agência Nacional de Águas e Saneamento Básico. Manual de Usos Consuntivos da Água no Brasil, 2ª edição, revisada e ampliada. Brasília: ANA, 2024, 109 numbered pages. ISBN 978-65-88101-64-3. [Official industrial-water index](https://www.gov.br/ana/pt-br/usos-da-agua/industria) · [Complete official book](https://www.snirh.gov.br/portal/snirh/centrais-de-conteudos/central-de-publicacoes/ana_manual_de_usos_consuntivos_da_agua_no_brasil.pdf).

Read the whole Portuguese account of withdrawal, consumption and the estimation of sectoral demands. Study chapter 3, Indústria de transformação, beginning on printed page 29, and compare its statistical methods with a measured plant balance. Continue through mining, thermal power and synthesis/applications when examining the infrastructure supplying a region.

The official 83.6 MB PDF was retrieved outside the repository on 30 October 2026; its cover, rights notice, contents and industrial-method text were inspected. The notice reserves rights while permitting reproduction of data and information with source attribution; separately credited material retains its own notices. Do not treat a regional coefficient or projection as a measurement of an individual plant. The PDF remains an external reference.

